[en.FOCUS_C14_FAMILY_RAISE_THIS_BARN]
Raise This Barn

[en.FOCUS_C14_FAMILY_RAISE_THIS_BARN_desc]
To commemorate the outstanding member of the Apple family, Applejack, the barn raising event from the last family reunion will become a tradition at every family gathering.

[zh.FOCUS_C14_FAMILY_RAISE_THIS_BARN]
搭起谷仓

[zh.FOCUS_C14_FAMILY_RAISE_THIS_BARN_desc]
为纪念苹果家族的杰出成员——苹果嘉儿，上次家族聚会中的谷仓搭建活动将成为每次家族聚会的惯例活动。

